 protein complexes based on a novel epitope combination</article-title><source>Eukaryot Cell</source><year>2005</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>1942</fpage><lpage>1950</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16278461</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/EC.4.11.1942-1950.2005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Sturm</surname><given-names>NR</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A non-universal transcription factor? The Leishmania tarentolae TATA box-binding protein LtTBP associates with a subset of promoters</article-title><source>Int J Parasitol</source><year>2006</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>1217</fpage><lpage>1226</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16753168</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijpara.2006.04.004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schimanski</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Brandenburg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Nguyen</surname><given-names>TN</given-names></name><name><surname>Caimano</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gunzl</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A TFIIB-like protein is indispensable for spliced leader RNA gene transcription in Trypanosoma brucei</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>1676</fpage><lpage>1684</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16554554</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkl090</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Palenchar</surname><given-names>JB</